<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="b5831c00"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="73556534">&lt;p&gt;
    Schedule conference calls and meetings with any Global Delivery Services (GDS) resources to maximize global resources.
    The purpose of the meetings is to clarify and hand-off assignments to GDS in order to facilitate around the clock
    development.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Manage any documentation such as offshore clarification trackers that may need to be utilized to answer ongoing areas
    of doubt. Trackers should be stored on a centralized repository for continuous communication.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
